          "TitleHtml": "<div class=\"chunk-title\">1.04.030 - Title\u2014Citation\u2014Reference.</div>",
          "ShouldShowMiniToc": false,
          "Id": "TIT1GEPR_CH1.04COAD_1.04.030TIITEF",
          "Title": "1.04.030 - Title\u2014Citation\u2014Reference.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               This recodified Code shall be known as the \"Long Beach Municipal Code\" and it shall\n               be sufficient to refer to said Code as the \"Long Beach Municipal Code\" in any prosecution\n               for the violation of any provision thereof or in any proceeding at law or equity.\n               It shall be sufficient to designate any ordinance adding to, amending, correcting\n               or repealing all or any part or portion thereof as an addition to, amendment to, correction\n               or repeal of the \"Long Beach Municipal Code.\" Further reference may be made to the\n               titles, chapters, sections and subsections of the Long Beach Municipal Code and such\n               references shall apply to that numbered title, chapter, section or subsection as it\n               appears in this Code.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. C-5831 \u00a7 1 (part), 1982)\n               </p></div>",
          "SortDate": null,
          "Footnotes": null
        }
      ],
