          "Title": "1.04.050 - Continuity.",
          "Content": "<div class=\"chunk-content\">\n            <p class=\"p0\">\n               The provisions of this recodification, insofar as they are substantially the same\n               as ordinance provisions previously adopted by the City relating to the same subject\n               matter, shall be construed as restatements, reenactments and continuations of such\n               provisions, and not as new enactments.\n               </p>\n            <p class=\"historynote0\">\n               (Ord. C-5831 \u00a7 1 (part), 1982)\n               </p></div>",
